# Windows (actions/actions_windows.kbd)
**windows + spc**        -- Show All (C-f10)
**windows + ent**        -- Maximize (M-pgup)
**windows + lsft + ent** -- Fullscreen (M-S-m)
**windows + rsft + ent** -- Fullscreen (M-S-m)
**windows + k**          -- Half Up (M-up)
**windows + j**          -- Half Down (M-down)
**windows + h**          -- Half Left (M-left)
**windows + l**          -- Half Right (M-right)
**windows + close**      -- Close (A-f4)
**windows + toggle**     -- Toggle (M-tab)
